  iter-71 EMERGENCY FIX: Resource shrinker keep-list.

  Explicitly prevents the R8/AGP resource shrinker from stripping launcher
  icon assets when shrinkResources = true is enabled in the future.

  Root cause: in iter-59 the adaptive-icon XML was stripped from the APK
  in some shrinker configurations because the shrinker traversed only the
  PNG resolution of @mipmap/ic_launcher. With the correct foreground vector
  at @drawable/ic_launcher_foreground, the keep-list below ensures ALL
  layers of the adaptive icon survive shrinker passes.

  See docs/KNOWN_DEFECTS.md #iter-71-launcher-icon-missing-postmortem.
-->
<resources xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    tools:keep="@mipmap/ic_launcher,@mipmap/ic_launcher_round,@drawable/ic_launcher_foreground,@color/ic_launcher_background"/>
